{"type":"message","id":"f9cb29ee","parentId":"edb9078b","timestamp":"2026-03-10T00:51:19.610Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"研究部提醒得对！涉及数据必须查证，不能随便写。我需要用 tushare 查询实际的黄金价格数据，以及用浏览器去金十数据看看。\n\n让我先用 tushare 查询黄金相关的数据。黄金可以用黄金ETF（518880）或者国际金价来参考。\n\n我应该查询：\n1. 黄金ETF（518880）从2月初到现在的日线数据\n2. 或者查询相关的黄金指数\n\n让我先查询黄金ETF的数据。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 明白！数据必须准确。让我用 tushare 查一下实际的黄金价格数据。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-d684e221c4804db8a05905009866438e","name":"tushare_stock_daily","arguments":{"ts_code":"518880.SH","start_date":"20260201","end_date":"20260310"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-1d9bdeeed48d4952969f9d0e2bd50572","name":"tushare_index_daily","arguments":{"ts_code":"GLNC.IB","start_date":"20260201","end_date":"20260310"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":36528,"output":310,"cacheRead":5631,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42469,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773103869853}}
